   "lines": [
    "Mrs. Lee; Alice and I",
    "went on to New York",
    "to stay ten days. We",
    "were met with open",
    "arms; Mother, Bamie, Conie[?]",
    "and Elliott are just too",
    "sweet to me for anything."
